  14| **Abstract.** This report presents a search for a 5 kW-class
  18| A differential-evolution campaign evaluated 930 candidate designs under one fixed power-law generator load, each scored on the measurement window (NR-001).
  21| Its mean mechanical power is 5.309 kW at the site wind, 11.01 m/s at 9.41 m (NR-008, NR-032).
  22| All checked TRPT rings and twist segments operate below their failure boundaries at the final operating point (NR-021, NR-022).
  23| The minimum factor of safety is 14.972 (NR-009).
  26| 2.03, at S1, the first of the five segments between the rings
  27| (NR-040).
