 299| (FoS) target and hard floor, both 2.5, and a line length of 18.8
 300| metres (NR-015).
 301| The campaign fixed k at 2.24 N·m/(rad/s)² for every candidate design (NR-015).
 311| The team selected the value in a load sweep of the seed machine (2026-08-22).
